            "required": 0,
            "conditional_logic": 0,
            "wrapper": {
                "width": "",
                "class": "",
                "id": ""
            },
            "default_value": "<p>Unlock a curated collection of professional-grade resources built to elevate your creative process and business growth. Whether you're designing, selling, or visualizing, this toolkit will help you work smarter and present better:<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Project Portfolio — Showcasing real work across architecture, product design, and real estate. Use it as a reference, inspiration or proof of quality when presenting to your own clients.<\/li>\r\n<li>Exclusive 3D Asset Pack — Save time with ready-made, high-quality 3D models for interiors, furniture, and decor. Perfect for streamlining your workflow.<\/li>\r\n<li>BIM Model Template Library — Pre-built templates for efficient BIM modeling, helping you maintain structure and consistency across projects.<\/li>",
