            },
            "default_value": "<p>Connect with our Business Development Manager to discuss your next steps and how we can support your goals.<\/p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Clarify your goals – We'll go over your project requirements, preferred style, timeline, and scope to match you with the right solutions.<\/li>\r\n<li>Understand our process – Learn how we manage projects efficiently and why we consistently receive top-rated feedback from clients.<\/li>\r\n<li>Review our work – See recent examples of photorealistic visualizations and the real-world impact they’ve had.<\/li>\r\n<li>Explore extra value – Discover additional services that can enhance your upcoming projects and simplify your workflow.<\/li>\r\n<\/ul>",
